FitXR;Jan 05, 2019;['FITAR LIMITED'];FitXR is our new virtual fitness studio that brings the energy and enjoyment of group fitness classes to your home.  /n  /n Designed to put the fun back into exercise, FitXR is packed full of workouts that will get your heart racing while putting a smile on your face, whatever your fitness level.  /n  /n Put on your VR headset and box and dance your way through workouts in time to adrenaline-pumping music.   /n  /n Available now on the Oculus Quest;['Oculus VR'];['Sport'];N/A;3;2;
